<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n49207" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θρόος</span></b> , 
			Att.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θροῦς</span></b> , ὁ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θρέομαι</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>noise</i> as of many voices, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐ γὰρ πάντων ἦεν ὁμὸς θ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				4.437
			</span></i>; poet. of musical sounds, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολύφατος θ. ὕμνων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>N.</u>
					7.81
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θ. αὐλῶν</span> Epic. ap. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.654f
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>murmur</i> of a crowd or assembly, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				4.66
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				8.79
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				6.57
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>report, rumour</i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				6.1.37
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Galb.</u>
				26
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.C.
				44.18
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
